                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2652f45e-29c0-3c37-bb37-6e12f14d4a01",
                        "entry_id": "9a0028e0-0119-3ad6-affd-f9fddef52565",
                        "glosses": [
                            "малодейственное, недостаточно эффективное мероприятие для осуществления, достижения чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1104ed89-5d22-4090-a2d8-65e6ebe8078c",
                                "sense_id": "2652f45e-29c0-3c37-bb37-6e12f14d4a01",
                                "text": "Когда мне со всех сторон грозит гибель, я прибегаю ко всем средствам. Когда я всего боюсь, я иду на все. В революции не может быть полумер… В.Гюго, «Девяносто третий год»"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9a44c3c8-9b79-4561-9b71-a167987dd44b",
                        "source_entry_id": "9a0028e0-0119-3ad6-affd-f9fddef52565",
                        "source_sense_id": "2652f45e-29c0-3c37-bb37-6e12f14d4a01",
                        "target_lang_word": "half-measure",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "half-measure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0bdd42cc-6d0b-3a25-a936-3c8d53dda41f",
                                        "entry_id": "540b08ca-2fb3-392b-81a3-5d4649a813ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An inadequate or incomplete solution to a problem."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f37fa56f-d09c-4f45-bf00-9b1869269cf8",
                                                "sense_id": "0bdd42cc-6d0b-3a25-a936-3c8d53dda41f",
                                                "text": "There is much stronger evidence that the title is a ruse, luring the viewer in by half measures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c61f2db-58a8-4870-9ca0-2e2ce76b684c",
                                                "sense_id": "0bdd42cc-6d0b-3a25-a936-3c8d53dda41f",
                                                "text": "As Mendicant stated in its report [58,078:H 48:M 12:S ago]: half measures will not suffice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ed9269b-7040-479b-ab90-4ae28dc090ab",
                                                "sense_id": "0bdd42cc-6d0b-3a25-a936-3c8d53dda41f",
                                                "text": "Science and philosophy must proceed by half-measures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dc5eced-1f73-41f1-961b-b196d1ee1b98",
                                                "sense_id": "0bdd42cc-6d0b-3a25-a936-3c8d53dda41f",
                                                "text": "The United States and United Nations responded to rough experiences by remaining mired in indecision and hamstrung by half-measures (Bosnia to 1995), facing failure and bailing out (Somalia), acting only after a long period of limited and misdirected pressure (Haiti), or holding back from action where more awesome disaster than anywhere else called for it (Rwanda)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
